!Name: p00065
!C 17 Mar 2004 Jason Summers first made this type of p65 gun
!C 18 Mar 2004 David Eppstein trimmed it by using a different endcap
!C  for one of the p130s and modifying two adjacent pairs of p5s.
!C  Scot Ellison welded the two pair for a reduction.
!C  Karel Suhajda welded the pair one cell closer.
!C 19 Mar 2004 David Eppstein's new p5 removes two rows and a column.
!C 07 Jun 2007 Nicolay Beluchenko's new p5 removes two more rows
!Source: guns1j-20121211
